  "summary": "This is an editorial portfolio organised around the work before the menu, with a short jar-based 3D sequence and clear apprentice, workshop and press routes. Its greatest weakness is that the 3D remains illustrative rather than essential, and the kitchen’s working documents do not shape the whole page."
